  "description": "Machine learning model for predicting patient no-shows at clinical appointments, actively deployed at UMC Utrecht. Identifies patients at high risk of missing appointments within a 3–10 day window, enabling proactive staff outreach. Ships as a FastAPI prediction service with a Streamlit calling dashboard for clinical staff. Developed and maintained by the UMCU Digital Health AI For Health team.",
